      "outcome": "updated",
      "group_id": "V-1A24B887",
      "rule_id": "SV-1A24B887r5EEF66",
      "rule_title": "Audit logs SHALL be maintained for at least the minimum duration dictated by OMB M-21-31 (Appendix C).",
      "fieldDiffs": [
        {
          "field": "discussion",
          "parts": [
            {
              "count": 99,
              "added": false,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "Audit logs SHALL be maintained for at least the minimum duration dictated by OMB M-21-31 (Appendix C).\n\nCriticality: SHALL.\nLast modified: June 2023.\n\nRationale: Audit logs may no longer be available when needed if they are not retained for a sufficient time.  Increased log retention time gives an agency the necessary visibility to investigate incidents that occurred some time ago. OMB M-21-13, Appendix C, Table 5 specifically calls out Unified Audit Logs in the Cloud Azure log category.\n\n"
            },
            {
              "count": 71,
              "added": true,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "Note: Microsoft 365 Purview (Premium) provides a default audit log retention policy, retaining Exchange Online, SharePoint Online, OneDrive for Business, and Microsoft Entra ID audit records for one year. Additional record types require custom audit retention policies. Agencies may also consider alternate storage locations and services to meet audit log retention needs.\n\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1070: Indicator Removal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "field": "fix_text",
          "parts": [
            {
              "count": 18,
              "added": false,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "See the following implementation steps to\ncreate an audit retention policy (./defender.md#"
            },
            {
              "count": 1,
              "added": false,
              "removed": true,
              "value": "msdefender62v1"
            },
            {
              "count": 1,
              "added": true,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "msdefender63v1"
            },
            {
              "count": 7,
              "added": false,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "-instructions)\nfor additional guidance."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
